  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Knorr_(brand)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Knorr</a> gravy recipe is a quick and easy way to make rich, flavorful gravy at home. With the help of Knorr bouillon and simple pantry ingredients, you can whisk up a silky sauce in just minutes. Perfect over mashed potatoes, roasted vegetables, or meats, this homemade gravy delivers comforting flavor with minimal effort. The Knorr gravy recipe is a family favorite that turns everyday meals into something special.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-knorr-gravy-recipe\">Why You’ll Love This knorr gravy recipe</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-the-best-knorr-gravy-recipe\">How to Make the Best Knorr Gravy Recipe</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-knorr-gravy-recipe\">Pro Tips for Making knorr gravy recipe</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-knorr-gravy-recipe\">How to Serve this knorr gravy recipe</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-knorr-gravy-recipe\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This knorr gravy recipe</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Quick and easy to prepare, perfect for busy weeknights.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Rich, savory flavor that elevates any dish.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile enough to pair with meats, veggies, or even mashed potatoes.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Uses simple ingredients you likely already have at home.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customizable to suit your taste with herbs and spices.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-3032\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"3032\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-padding-40 meadow-header\">\n  <div class=\"wprm-layout-column-container wprm-column-gap-20 wprm-column-rows-recipe-600 wprm-column-rows-reverse wprm-row-gap-20 meadow-header-columns\">\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-align-center\">\n      <div class=\"wprm-recipe-image wprm-block-image-rounded\"><img decoding=\"async\" style=\"border-width: 0px;border-style: solid;border-color: #666666;border-radius: 20px;width: 300px;max-width: 100%;height: 300px;object-fit: cover;\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Delicious-Peanut-Sauce-Delight.webp\" class=\"attachment-999999x300 size-999999x300\" alt=\"Close-up of a ladle dripping peanut sauce from a pot, with a cozy kitchen setting blurred in the background.\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Delicious-Peanut-Sauce-Delight.webp 500w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Delicious-Peanut-Sauce-Delight-300x300.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Delicious-Peanut-Sauce-Delight-150x150.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-column-width-75 wprm-align-rows-center\">\n      <div class=\"wprm-layout-container meadow-header-accent\" style=\"--wprm-layout-container-text-color: var(--meadow-accent-color);\">\n        \n      </div>\n      <h2 class=\"wprm-recipe-name wprm-block-text-bold\">knorr gravy recipe</h2>\n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div>\n      <div class=\"wprm-recipe-summary wprm-block-text-normal\">Discover the ultimate knorr gravy recipe that elevates your meals! Quick, easy, and delicious—perfect for any dish! 🍽️✨</div>\n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 20px;\"></div>\n      <div class=\"wprm-layout-container\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/